# का / के: the genitive postposition (संबंध कारक) in its direct and
# oblique masculine forms.  Kamtaprasad Guru, Hindi Vyakaran (1927),
# p. 265, declension table, row संबंध: "बालक का-के-की"; p. 179, §232 (ग)
# lists का-के-की among the bound postpositions.  "अगले हफ़्ते के रविवार
# को" takes the oblique के because को follows the head noun.  The
# feminine की is left out: it joins no date word this locale reads.
का
के
